{"id":"3e4a39dd9e2f4f00","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md","title":"Non-Principal Ultrafilter","display":"df-nonprincipal — Non-Principal Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-nonprincipal","aliases":["58-df-nonprincipal"],"display":"df-nonprincipal — Non-Principal Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-nonprincipal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-nonprincipal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonprincipal — Non-Principal Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (超滤, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha &lt; \\kappa\">\\(\\alpha &lt; \\kappa\\)</span> (ordinal below kappa)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (超滤 index cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> (non-principal-ultrafilter predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonprincipal} \\vdash \\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land \\forall \\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonprincipal} \\vdash \\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land \\forall \\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 不包含任何单点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\alpha\\}\">\\(\\{\\alpha\\}\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是非主的</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是无限集，则 ZFC 可将其余有限滤子扩张为非主超滤子；有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 上不存在非主超滤子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ (超滤, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha < \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonprincipal} \\vdash \\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S(U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land \\forall \\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":911,"backlinks":[{"id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md]])."},{"id":"c54c1c2b7d1b7133","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (nonprincipal-ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md]])"},{"id":"6330830824bc3850","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NonPrincipal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (nonprincipal-ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md]])"},{"id":"69ebe15818f1e306","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-878","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md|58-df-nonprincipal]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8"]}